The skills in skills/ are original text written from the public Adobe Commerce
documentation listed below. Code examples are adapted from the examples in that
documentation, with vendor and module names changed to generic ones. No code
from the magento/magento2 repository is included.

Each SKILL.md ends with a "Reference" section that lists the exact source files
it was written from and the public page of each one. The commits below are the
